# Copy to .env.production when you deploy.
#
# Where the browser sends API calls. Keep it relative (/api) so requests stay on
# your own origin: Vite forwards /api in development and vercel.json proxies it in
# production, which keeps the sign-in cookie first-party.
#
# Only use an absolute https URL for a deliberately cross-origin backend, which
# also needs CORS with credentials and SameSite=None on the cookie (see
# docs/AUTHENTICATION.md).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
